---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../../../components/Footer.astro';
import StudioModal from '../../../../components/StudioModal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Approach — Adaptive Studio"
  description="How and why we work with the autonomic nervous system. Polyvagal theory, conscious movement and practical recovery skills."
  lang="en"
>
  <StudioModal lang="en" />
  <Nav lang="en" />

  <main>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-10">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-10 reveal"
          style="font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem)">
        Approach
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Working consciously with the nervous system is not just rest or temporary relief.<br>
        It is a skill that can be learned.<br>
        We help build it through movement, breath and proven methods that have a clear effect on the body.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Studio equipment -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24 border-t border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-50/70">

      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">STUDIO TOOLS</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          What kind of support we offer in the studio.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Every tool in the studio has a clear role. You are not choosing technology for its own sake, but the kind of support that makes sense for your body, your load, and your goal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200 items-stretch">

        <div class="flex h-full flex-col lg:pr-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">For calm and better recovery</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Red Light Therapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Suitable for people under pressure, after demanding training, or in phases when the body struggles to switch off. We use red light where the goal is to support recovery, release tension, and restore deeper rest.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 space-y-5">
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-100">
              <img src="/images/red-light-therapy.webp" alt="Red Light Therapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="max-w-xs space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Solves</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['stress', 'tension', 'fatigue', 'poor sleep'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Goal</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['recovery', 'relaxation', 'better sleep', 'faster recovery'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex h-full flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">For resilience and post-load recovery</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Cryotherapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Suitable for active people, athletes, and anyone who wants to improve how the body responds to stress. We use cold when we want to wake the system up, support post-effort recovery, and train the shift from tension back into calm.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 space-y-5">
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-100">
              <img src="/images/cryo-chamber.webp" alt="Cryotherapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="max-w-xs space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Solves</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['overload', 'muscle fatigue', 'slow recovery', 'low resilience'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Goal</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['resilience', 'energy', 'sports recovery', 'faster recovery'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex h-full flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">For targeted body recovery</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Magnetotherapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Suitable for those who do not need more output, but more support for recovery. We use magnetotherapy when it makes sense to work more deeply with tissue recovery and the body’s return to balance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 space-y-5">
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-100">
              <img src="/images/magnetic-stimulation.webp" alt="Magnetotherapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="max-w-xs space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Solves</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['muscle pain', 'overworked body', 'tissue recovery', 'overall fatigue'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Goal</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['body recovery', 'relief', 'healing', 'balance'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex h-full flex-col lg:pl-8 reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">For strength and confidence in movement</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Strength Training</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              For people who want to start intelligently, improve movement quality, or support long-term performance without chaos. We build training to develop strength, stability, and body control without unnecessary nervous-system overload.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 space-y-5">
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-100">
              <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-sage opacity-50"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-sage opacity-50"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                <p class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-400 uppercase">Strength Training</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="max-w-xs space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Solves</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['weak core', 'instability', 'poor posture', 'movement insecurity'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-zinc-400 mb-2">Goal</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {['strength', 'stability', 'better fitness', 'healthy movement'].map((item) => (
                    <span class="px-3 py-2 border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900">
                      {item}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Process — three columns -->
    <section class="min-h-screen border-t border-zinc-100">
      <div class="bg-[#111110] px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 pt-24 pb-16">
        <div class="mb-16 reveal">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
            How to restart your body’s recovery.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-4 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
            We designed practical training of breath, mind, and movement that consciously teach the nervous system to change tone and rhythm.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 md:divide-x divide-zinc-800 gap-16 md:gap-0">
          <div class="md:pr-12 reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-800 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
               style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">01</p>
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">
              Release overload
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              We teach breath and meditation techniques that help the body and nervous system come out of survival mode.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="md:px-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-800 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
               style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">02</p>
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">
              Restart recovery
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              We move into a parasympathetic state where the nervous system feels safe, recovers, and rebuilds strength.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="md:pl-12 reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-800 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
               style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">03</p>
            <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">
              Build resilience
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              The goal is not to live without stress, but to step out of it consciously and allow both body and mind to restore their energy. That is the resilience we want to build.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 pb-24">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200 gap-0">
          <div class="md:pr-12 reveal reveal-delay-1">
            <div class="w-full aspect-[3/4] bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/images/nebezpeci.webp" alt="Release overload" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="md:px-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <div class="w-full aspect-[3/4] bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/images/bezpeci.webp" alt="Restart recovery" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="md:pl-12 reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <div class="w-full aspect-[3/4] bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/images/odolnost.webp" alt="Build resilience" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.05, rootMargin: '0px 0px -5% 0px' }
  );

  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => {
    const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
    if (rect.top < window.innerHeight) {
      el.classList.add('visible');
    } else {
      observer.observe(el);
    }
  });
</script>
